	measure 'Planned Item By Endate' = ```
			
			 VAR        _ItemsByEndDate          =    CALCULATE(SUM(ShopOrders[PlannedQuantity])
			                                            ,FILTER(ShopOrders, ShopOrders[EntryDateWeekNr] <> ShopOrders[PlannedEndDateWeekNr]))                                           
			VAR         _If             =       IF(_ItemsByEndDate = -0, BLANK(),  _ItemsByEndDate)
			VAR         _Result         =        _If
			
			RETURN
			_Result
			```
		displayFolder: ShopOrder
		lineageTag: a5888d80-cf3d-49d2-b85d-e22d2de653e2

